WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.479
Words with a faint dotted underline can be tapped.

00:00:03.479 --> 00:00:09.737
You'll see the original Hebrew or Greek word, what it means, and where else it appears in Scripture.

00:00:10.539 --> 00:00:13.023
To mark a passage, tap a verse number.

00:00:13.023 --> 00:00:18.646
Tap more numbers to select several verses together, and then choose a highlight color.

00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:25.075
From the same bar, you can write a note, or start a journal entry about those verses.

00:00:25.075 --> 00:00:27.789
Type it, or tap the microphone and speak.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:34.563
The Study tab gathers commentaries, cross references, and background for the chapter you're reading.

00:00:35.365 --> 00:00:41.530
Maps and Helps has maps for every chapter, the journeys of Jesus and of Paul, and much more.

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:46.757
Tap the corner button to see a map full screen, and tap it again to come back.
